invalid type: string "Enterprise RAG System Overview\n\nThis is an enterprise retrieval-augmented generation system built with FastAPI and ChromaDB.\nIt supports ingestion from GitHub repositories, Jira tickets, and uploaded documents.\nThe system uses Ollama with llama3 for local LLM inference, ensuring data stays on-premise.\n/a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col install\">\n"cuopon\">\n